<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - W.R. Grace dowgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - W.R. Grace dowgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it lowered its recommendation on W.R. Grace &amp; Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares added 1/2 to 52-3/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
